| Instantiation | ~4–6 ns | ~4–6 ns | ≈1.0x |
| Field Access (3 fields) | ~3–5 ns | ~3–5 ns | ≈1.0x |
| Copy / Manual Reconstruct | ~8–12 ns | ~8–12 ns | ≈1.0x |

> **Key observation**: The difference is within noise margin (<5%). The JIT compiles both to nearly identical bytecode patterns.

### Bytecode Comparison

Both produce similar hot-spot-optimized bytecode:

