### 🔹 Realistic Timing Expectations (Modern x86-64, 3.5+ GHz, L1/L2 cache resident)
| Algorithm                  | Typical Time Range | Variance (99th %ile) | Stability |
|----------------------------|-------------------|----------------------|-----------|
